  "body_html": "<h1>Langlands Mathematics Database</h1>\n<p>The Langlands Mathematics Database is a dependency-first mathematical knowledge\nbase for the Langlands program.</p>\n<p>The database is organized around mathematical themes and large topic nodes\nbefore it is refined into concrete definition, construction, example, lemma,\nproposition, theorem, and proof-plan nodes.</p>\n<p>The ordinary group case is treated as a basic special case of the broader\nrelative viewpoint: spaces with group action, such as homogeneous and spherical\nspaces, are part of the foundational organization from the beginning.</p>",
